(P110 - Q5 first G38 raster-row diagnostic)
(Requires fresh Q2. Tests one clear first row; cleans up Aux0 automatically.)

M5
G4 P3.0
G21 G90 G94 G17 G54
M64 P0
G4 P2.0
G53 G0 X-280.0 Y-266.0
M65 P0
G4 P2.0
o110 if [#<_probe_state> NE 1]
  M64 P0
  (print,P110 READY acknowledgement missing)
  o901 error[39]
o110 endif
M64 P0
G4 P0.10
o111 if [#<_probe_state> NE 0]
  (print,P110 READY acknowledgement did not release)
  o902 error[39]
o111 endif
M65 P0
G4 P0.10
o112 if [#<_probe_state> NE 0]
  M64 P0
  (print,P110 southwest scan corner is magnetically active)
  o903 error[39]
o112 endif
(print,P110 first clear G38.3 row: X=-280 to X=-180 at Y=-266)
G91 G38.3 X100.0 F1000.0
G90
M64 P0
o113 if [#5070 EQ 1]
  (print,P110 unexpected magnetic hit on first clear row)
o113 else
  (print,P110 complete: clear first G38.3 row passed)
o113 endif
o110 return [1]
